Privacy Policy
Effective Date: 01/28/2025

Owner: AllSmart Inc.

AllSmart Inc. ("we," "us," or "our") values your privacy and is committed to protecting your personal information. By using the Rebalance APP ("App"), you agree to the collection and use of information as described in this Privacy Policy.

1. No Financial Advice & No Liability
The App is provided for informational and portfolio management purposes only. It does not provide financial, investment, or trading advice. You are solely responsible for your investment decisions, and AllSmart Inc. is not liable for any losses incurred due to market volatility, incorrect configurations, or actions taken based on information within the App.

AllSmart Inc. is not responsible for any errors, delays, or failures in executing trades, as all transactions are performed through third-party brokerages. Users should verify all trade details before execution. Additionally, users should always verify the recommended rebalance operations and total order values with their corresponding brokerage system. Market volatility and prices will ultimately be executed and finalized by the brokerage and its processing mechanisms.

2. Data Collection & Storage
The App does not collect, store, or share any personally identifiable information (PII). The App only interacts with brokerage accounts using secure authentication methods.

3. Security & Encryption
The App stores brokerage access keys (API key and secret) retrieved from the brokerage system (E*TRADE) to facilitate secure API requests.
These credentials are stored using Android's AES/GCM/NoPadding encryption mechanism, ensuring data remains encrypted on the device.
The App does not transmit or share brokerage credentials with any external parties.
While we implement industry-standard encryption mechanisms, AllSmart Inc. cannot guarantee absolute security, and users acknowledge that they use the App at their own risk.
Users are responsible for securing their devices and ensuring that unauthorized parties do not gain access to their brokerage credentials.
4. Third-Party Brokerages
The App currently integrates with E*TRADE and may support additional brokerages in the future. Users are subject to the respective brokerage's terms and conditions when executing trades through the App. AllSmart Inc. has no control over brokerage services, transaction processing, or account management.

5. Data Sharing & Third Parties
We do not sell, rent, or share any user data with third parties. Any data processed within the App remains on the user’s device and is used solely for interacting with the brokerage API.

6. Liability & Security Disclaimer
While we take strong measures to protect user data, no security system is impenetrable. By using the App, you acknowledge and agree that:

AllSmart Inc. is not liable for any unauthorized access, data breaches, or security incidents that may compromise your brokerage credentials.
Users should regularly update their device security, use strong passwords, and follow best security practices to minimize risks.
In the event of suspected unauthorized access, users should immediately revoke their brokerage API credentials and contact their brokerage provider for further assistance.
7. Changes to this Privacy Policy
We reserve the right to update or modify this Privacy Policy at any time. Any significant changes will be communicated through the App or other appropriate means. Your continued use of the App constitutes acceptance of any changes.

8. Contact Information
If you have any questions regarding this Privacy Policy, you may contact us at:

AllSmart Inc.
contact@allsmartinc.com

By using the App, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agreed to this Privacy Policy. If you do not agree, please discontinue use of the App immediately.